# ==============================================================================
# Git Exclusion Rules — Strict Code-Only & Privacy Boundary
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Ignore ALL Markdown & Discussion/Note Files except README.md
*.md
!README.md

# 2. Agent Guidelines, Developer Notes, Prompts & Research
AGENTS*
agents*
BUILD_NOTES*
build_notes*
CHANGELOG*
changelog*
notes/
skills/
docs/
research/
prompts/
starting_prompt.md
*.pdf
*.docx


# 3. Environment Variables & Secrets
.env
.env.local
.env.*
!.env.example

# 4. Dependencies & Build Artifacts
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/

# 5. System, Editor & Log Files
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
